==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|kole|g=f}} alongside commoner {{m|gmh|kol|g=n}}, from {{inh|de|goh|kol|g=n}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*kulą|g=n}}, from {{inh|de|ine-pro|*gʷol-}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*ǵwelH-||to burn, shine}}. The feminine form is chiefly of [[Central German|Central]] and [[Low German]] origin ({{der|de|gml|kōle|g=f}}). Cognate with {{cog|nl|kool|g=f}}, {{cog|da|kul|g=n}}, {{cog|en|coal}}.

